いっぱいで持てませんでした</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Acquired {16}{25}{C2}{C0}, but
inventory is full already.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <JapaneseText>何もありません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nothing else here.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <JapaneseText>{16}{35}{D8}{C0}作ってる？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Are you making {16}{35}{D8}{C0}?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <JapaneseText>{16}{35}{D8}{C0}の作り方を
知りたいですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Would you like to know 
how to make {16}{35}{D8}{C0}?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;03:00000000&gt;　はい　
　いいえ　</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;03:00000000&gt; Yes 
No </EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <JapaneseText>{16}{35}{D8}{C0}の作り方を
教えてあげよう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I will teach you
how to make {16}{35}{D8}{C0}</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <JapaneseText>自分で作るのかい？
まぁ、それもいいだろう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Did you make it by yourself?
Well, that's fine.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <JapaneseText>{16}{35}{D8}{C0}のレシピがあるんだが、
&lt;0B:00000001&gt;{14}{35}{D0}{C0}&lt;0B:00000000&gt;ガルドで買わないか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've got a recipe for {16}{35}{D8}{C0}.
Would you like to buy it for &lt;0B:00000001&gt;{14}{35}{D0}{C0}&lt;0B:00000000&gt; gald?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;03:00000000&gt;　はい　
　いいえ　</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;03:00000000&gt; Yes 
 No </EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
