      <JapaneseText>{16}{35}{D8}{C0}を作るのに必要な食材は
{18}{45}{D4}{C0}です </JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In order to make {16}{35}{D8}{C0} you need
these ingredients {18}{45}{D4}{C0}</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <JapaneseText>材料を持っているじゃないか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You dont have the necessary ingredients</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ゆずってくれれば{16}{35}{D8}{C0}を
作るがどうだい？ </JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hand over the ingredients 
to make {16}{35}{D8}{C0}?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;03:00000000&gt;　はい
　いいえ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;03:00000000&gt; Yes
 No</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <JapaneseText>そうか、待ってな　
すぐに{16}{35}{D8}{C0}を作ってやるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, wait here
I'll go cook {16}{35}{D8}{C0} at once</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <JapaneseText>残念だな
凄く美味いのに･･･</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What a shame!
It's too good...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <JapaneseText>食材を探しているんだ
見つけたら持ってきてくれないかい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm looking for ingredients, if you
find some can you bring them to me?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <JapaneseText>お前には資格がない
また、出直して来るといい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're not qualified
Well, you'll have to visit again</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <JapaneseText>お前のような奴を待ってた
これをゆずるのに相応しい料理人を</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've been waiting for someone like you.
A cook worthy of this recipe!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
